Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:02.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請冷靜下來 不要慌亂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:03.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼蠢話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:05.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的攻擊還沒完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:06.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,居然突然就打過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:08.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,市內各處都是一片恐慌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.63,0:00:11.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,完全無法收拾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:15.53,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(644,628)}{\fad(500,500}{\blur4}ZAFT軍 機動要塞 Messiah 司令室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:13.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但妳的工作就是制止這些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.39,0:00:17.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:25.50,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(644,628)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}地球聯合軍 Daedalus基地 司令室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:23.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT艦隊有行動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.23,0:00:25.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yellow 136 Alpha
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:28.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem盡快補給能量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第2樂章配置如何了?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:32.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要保住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要埋葬Aprilius
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先求援
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:40.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}不 這我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:43.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但其間第2發打過來怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.15,0:00:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有什麼和談 停戰之類的方法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:49.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停戰 對方不是國家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:52.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和恐怖分子還能怎麼交涉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道要屈服於武力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:57.45,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(638,628)}地球聯合軍 Daedalus基地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第8軌道艦隊出擊中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:59.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員 第2戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:02.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防禦陣形 Quebec-Zulu-November
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:03.96,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(642,626)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}地球聯合軍 Arzachel基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:04.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我們也出動第3艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:07.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要確實守住炮壘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:13.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和Gondwana會合 快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:14.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:16.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不能再讓PLANT被打中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:13.77,title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur3}{\fad(500,500)}變革的序曲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:12.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Akatsuki收容作業開始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.60,0:03:15.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}整備8班到5號機庫待機
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.51,0:03:15.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 我來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的做完了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:18.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.83,0:03:20.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又逞強很累的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:22.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從哪開始　電波式計算的設定如何
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進行到程序2了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:31.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要更換緩衝器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣了呢 PLANT那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:41.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我想ZAFT一定會制止更多的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:43.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很焦急吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:46.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使知道現在還無能為力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒聯絡上司令部嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:55.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請稍等 剛剛…收到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.39,0:03:58.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是…匿名代碼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:05.49,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(652,628)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}ZAFT軍 機動要塞 Messiah 議長室
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.19,0:04:02.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以Gondwana為中心的月球艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:05.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正在炮的第一中繼站交戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva改變會合計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.78,0:04:10.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即前往消滅敵軍炮台主體
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:11.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,光憑我們就要消滅炮台主體嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.47,0:04:17.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道是不是只有我們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:20.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之這是對本艦下達的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:24.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實從這裡到Daedalus基地較近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:26.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是基於此判斷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:31.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在不知道其能量填充週期的情況下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.57,0:04:34.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,問題就是時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:37.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,急急忙忙衝過去卻沒趕上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:39.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就沒有任何意義
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.71,0:04:42.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵軍注意力集中在月球艦隊上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.73,0:04:46.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,順利的話 會成為暗渡陳倉的奇襲之計
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:47.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:49.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奇襲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:52.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實會是一場苦戰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 不得不面對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:57.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:05:00.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:02.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.49,0:05:07.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個東西 絕不能再讓它發射
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.56,0:05:10.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:11.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:16.48,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(970,664)}{\blur4}月面都市 哥白尼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:24.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem 運行率48%
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:28.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第2樂章 即將配置完成
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還靠不上去嗎 走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:47.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.31,0:06:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第2發之前 若月球艦隊攻下第一中繼站
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:02.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能勉強保住PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果他們的能量補給夠快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:07.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,整個艦隊都會被掃清
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:13.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,手握發射按鈕的就是這種人 該知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.24,0:06:17.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,罪魁禍首就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Logos的羅德 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我在奧布打下他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:31.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是露娜的錯 錯的是包庇他的奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別那麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.02,0:06:36.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何 時間無法倒流
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:40.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼想的話就別重蹈覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:41.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:46.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊　PLANT和月球艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:49.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都絕能不再被那個打中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就說明一下作戰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:05.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem 運行率50%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:07.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:11.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能撐住就是我們贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣總算能結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:17.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和他們之間的漫長戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.98,0:07:23.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.76,0:07:26.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,至今沒人能做到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:27.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由我來完成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,歷史終於能走上正途
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:32.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,數小時之後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:35.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將到達敵軍制空圈內
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:37.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:40.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:42.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到搭乘機待機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧 露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:48.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別弄錯時機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:49.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.04,0:07:51.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:53.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會盡可能掩護妳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:55.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但基本上別奢望什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:58.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就能有多餘的空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.48,0:07:59.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.28,0:08:01.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白 請放心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:02.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次絕不容許失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.99,0:08:08.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.71,0:08:13.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,盡快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:20.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,小心點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.68,0:08:22.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但還是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:31.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要露娜一個人打下炮的控制台
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:32.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:33.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:35.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這還是得我或者雷來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:36.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:37.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.15,0:08:39.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:43.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,佯攻基地也一樣危險
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.75,0:08:50.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事的 相信我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:52.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:53.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真你們才是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:05.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:08.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜 船艦和PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:10.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全都由我來守護
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:12.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:26.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克  核心戰機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,10點方向 有艦影接近
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:47.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.53,0:09:49.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離50 ZAFT軍 Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:51.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳 為什麼現在才發現
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,警報 緊急出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:09:58.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即開始迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:07.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急起飛命令 全機出動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:09.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複 全機出動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS Tristan Isolde啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.10,0:10:25.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,1號到10號管 全部裝填Neidhart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:28.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:31.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路  Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  Destiny出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:46.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,3號8號管 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:50.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,衝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:08.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 Minerva抵達Daedalus
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.27,0:11:11.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 已經來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:12.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:14.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,期盼他們的表現吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:25.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Isolde 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:34.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵15 下舵10
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:35.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入山的陰影部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:37.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tannhauser啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:40.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥情報即時傳到市內去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:42.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,完全原樣照播
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:45.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有在殖民地上戰鬥的他們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.88,0:11:47.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:49.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:51.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會發生混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:53.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家應該都想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:57.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己的命運 還有其前途
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.70,0:12:01.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且也有這權利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:02.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:06.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destroy還沒出擊嗎 敵人只有一艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:07.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼打不下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.26,0:12:13.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:14.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:17.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那些傢伙好了傷疤又忘痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:21.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主武器庫連接 額定輸出
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:22.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,解除保險
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:24.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:12:59.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:01.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別動隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:14.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第6區出現新的敵人MS
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destroy 2號機也沉默了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:18.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem 運行率61%
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:21.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第8機動隊沒有回應
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:23.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:25.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是最大功率也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:28.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射 掃清他們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:29.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.67,0:13:42.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 福萊發生異常
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:44.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法就位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的話這樣也好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:49.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕少了福萊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:50.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:53.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根本無法堅持到下次充電的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:54.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別管了發射
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趁此空隙逃離
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.79,0:13:59.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我活著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.73,0:14:01.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總有可行之路
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:04.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓基地投降 同時發射
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:06.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,理由要多少有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:08.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:13.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一同逃往Arzachel的話 還能…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.89,0:14:27.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走 指揮室就在前面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會讓露娜有意外
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:34.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.22,0:14:37.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:48.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球艦隊也在奮戰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:50.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一步 別鬆懈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.98,0:14:51.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.09,0:14:56.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 適可而止啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:04.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是那個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:09.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.83,0:15:12.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去基地的司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:17.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem 運行率63%
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:20.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量輸出良好 確認力場形成
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:24.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,爆破回路S116 斷路器啟動中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:27.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兆倍電容五號 儲電率70%
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主粉碎器 就緒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:33.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這些傢伙還…可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:50.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是它了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.71,0:15:53.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊發器開啟 開始倒計時
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.95,0:15:55.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離發射T-35
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:59.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 打開全頻回路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.93,0:16:00.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射權給我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多謝 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:06.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 永別了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:14.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:17.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:19.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不睡的話對傷口不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一早就要出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:23.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:28.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡那麼平靜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.76,0:17:30.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:33.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能一直待在這種世界呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:38.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是因為有夢想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願望 希望什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說得難聽點 是慾望…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:54.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想這麼做那麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:58.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都會這麼想 所以才不能留在原地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:01.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭不也是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:07.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是 卡嘉莉和拉克絲應該也是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.35,0:18:12.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而議長所說的世界裡沒有這些
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:16.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 某種意義上能一直待在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:19.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不如說命令你一直在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:21.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話的確什麼都不會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種戰爭可能也不會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:28.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.97,0:18:29.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:32.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這算是任性
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:35.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也說不定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:39.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過　所以人才能生存下來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.94,0:18:42.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在漫長的歲月中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.65,0:18:45.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不該戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是不該不戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:56.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家的夢想若是一樣就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 大概是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:06.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻不知道這點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:08.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:18.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球的具體形勢還不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:23.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,眼下時期 也很難保証不會發生任何問題
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:28.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大天使號正式編入奧布軍第2宇宙艦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:30.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會盡全力支援
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT方才蒙受巨大損失
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:39.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在狄蘭達爾議長是世界最強的領袖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:42.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何他都是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:44.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看似通曉一切　不可動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:49.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也會有和我們一樣畏懼其巨大力量的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:53.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布雖然比任何國家都嚮往和平
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:57.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這必須構築在自由自主的基礎上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:00.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會選擇臣服和從屬
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.64,0:20:06.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大天使號作為其捍衛者 希望也能出一份力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:15.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦現在開始前往月面都市哥白尼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進行情報收集工作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:20.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,30分鐘後起飛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:21.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,乘員各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:22.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:26.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅阿諾克上校
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:28.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Akatsuki就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:29.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:30.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.01,0:20:33.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:37.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:39.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用著急
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:44.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢想是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:53.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來能一起成行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:55.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:02.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒法一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.00,0:21:07.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你們平安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:42.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主動力連接
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.51,0:21:44.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,系統全部正常
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:49.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.97,0:21:52.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼上路吧　艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.78,0:21:56.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel　出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:26.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並非真相
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.95,0:23:29.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也並非只是虛偽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.32,0:23:33.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法實現的夢想莫非是不能追逐的禁忌之光
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.07,0:23:38.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那些想操縱夢想的人們會…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:43.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.13,0:23:45.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真實之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:49.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘記悲傷的淚水 Haro
